---
title: "图 07：Workspace 访问与运行时认证时序"
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as 客户
    participant Browser
    participant CP as Control Plane
    participant Fabric
    participant Runtime as OPL App Runtime
    participant Storage as Workspace Storage

    Customer->>Browser: 打开 /w/{workspaceId}/
    Browser->>CP: Session + Workspace URL
    CP->>CP: 校验 Account、Workspace 权益和 paidThrough
    CP->>Fabric: 读取 Runtime Status
    Fabric-->>CP: ready + Service Binding
    CP->>Runtime: 代理 HTML / API / WebSocket
    Runtime->>Runtime: Workspace 密码与 Session 验证
    Runtime->>Storage: 读取项目、文件和产物
    Storage-->>Runtime: Workspace-owned content
    Runtime-->>Browser: 在线 OPL App
